<title>USA: Lucille Farms extends warrants until 1997.</title>
<headline>Lucille Farms extends warrants until 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MONTVILLE, N.J. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucille Farms Inc said on Monday it was extending the expiration date for its warrants to November 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The warrants were to expire November 1, 1996, it said.</p>
<p>Each warrant entitles the holder to purchase one share of common stock at an exercise price of $5.00.</p>
<p>Lucille Farms Inc makes and markets cheese products.</p>
